00`\n- 停顿位移：`0.000`\n- JavaScript 语法检查通过。喵～","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3,"customData":{"verbatim":true,"source":"/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a06001-ef4f-71d1-821e-9ee52c2faff3.md","message":"M011","role":"output","part":1,"parts":1,"sourceText":"已更新 [思维地形.html](/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/思维地形.html)：\n\n- 路径改为弧长重采样，小球全程恒速移动。\n- 线头与小球共享同一进度，不再各快各慢。\n- 去掉路径整体横向变形，改为真实连续连接路径。\n- 纠偏场景会先进入错误深沟，停顿约 1.3 秒，再沿新路径离开。\n- 增加亚采样插值，避免小球逐点跳动。\n\n检查结果：\n\n- 路径步距误差比：`1.065`\n- 移动速率比：`1.000`\n- 停顿位移：`0.000`\n- JavaScript 语法检查通过。喵～"}},{"id":"s328","type":"text","x":4152.6,"y":904.8000000000001,"width":770,"height":24.7,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#8b9699","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-01-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-01-01","roundness":null,"seed":42328,"version":1,"versionNonce":92328,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":"file:///Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a06001-ef4f-71d1-821e-9ee52c2faff3.md","locked":false,"text":"01a06001 · M011","originalText":"01a06001 · M011","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s329","type":"line","x":4133.6,"y":964.8000000000001,"width":0.0,"height":95.80000000000007,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2b7c8c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.8,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-01-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-01-01","roundness":null,"seed":42329,"version":1,"versionNonce":92329,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0.0,0.0],[0.0,95.80000000000007]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":null,"elbowed":false},{"id":"s330","t