沟。\n- 原偏移沟保留浅层残迹。\n\n`03 语义惯性`\n\n- 新增“归档目标”形成的正确浅沟。\n- 小球会先离开旧路径，尝试朝新目标移动。\n- 历史删除峡谷随后形成回拉沟，将小球重新捕获。\n- 最终回到错误历史深谷，不再是从头到尾始终走旧路线。\n\n检查通过：历史峡谷相对新目标沟的深度优势为 `2.072`，因\n果顺序和路径连续性正常。[查看文件](/Users/w/code/For-\nUse-AI/思维地形.html) 喵～","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3,"customData":{"verbatim":true,"source":"/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a06001-ef4f-71d1-821e-9ee52c2faff3.md","message":"M044","role":"output","part":1,"parts":1,"sourceText":"已完成两项调整：\n\n`02 注意力稀释`\n\n- 多轮上下文分别形成两段偏移沟，不再整条同时出现。\n- 第一段表达上下文增加、主沟开始变浅。\n- 第二段表达英文内容进一步强化偏移。\n- “说中文”后再形成独立纠偏沟。\n- 原偏移沟保留浅层残迹。\n\n`03 语义惯性`\n\n- 新增“归档目标”形成的正确浅沟。\n- 小球会先离开旧路径，尝试朝新目标移动。\n- 历史删除峡谷随后形成回拉沟，将小球重新捕获。\n- 最终回到错误历史深谷，不再是从头到尾始终走旧路线。\n\n检查通过：历史峡谷相对新目标沟的深度优势为 `2.072`，因果顺序和路径连续性正常。[查看文件](/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/思维地形.html) 喵～"}},{"id":"s377","type":"text","x":7142.6,"y":1040.0,"width":770,"height":24.7,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#8b9699","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-01-03-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-01-03","roundness":null,"seed":42377,"version":1,"versionNonce":92377,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":"file:///Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a06001-ef4f-71d1-821e-9ee52c2faff3.md","locked":false,"text":"01a06001 · M044","originalText":"01a06001 · M044","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s378","type":"line","x":7993.6,"y":310,"width":0.0,"height":95.80000000000001,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2b7c8c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.8,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-01-03-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-01-03","roundness":null,"seed":42378,"version":1,"versionNonce":92378,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[]