，这些细节的丢失，整体再回顾下图片"}},{"id":"s962","type":"text","x":5212.6,"y":15479.4,"width":770,"height":24.7,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#8b9699","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42962,"version":1,"versionNonce":92962,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":"file:///Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0a87b-54cf-7e90-8fe2-f550ac2f1076.md","locked":false,"text":"01a0a87b · M025","originalText":"01a0a87b · M025","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s963","type":"rectangle","x":6070.6,"y":15194,"width":796,"height":727.2,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e2dcc0","backgroundColor":"#faf8ed","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":0.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.5,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":42963,"version":1,"versionNonce":92963,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"s964","type":"line","x":6063.6,"y":15210,"width":0.0,"height":704.2000000000007,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7b6292","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.8,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42964,"version":1,"versionNonce":92964,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0.0,0],[0.0,704.2000000000007]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":null,"elbowed":false},{"id":"s965","type":"ellipse","x":6054.6,"y":15204,"width":18,"height":18,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7b6292","backgroundColor":"#fff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.8,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42965,"version":1,"versionNonce":92965,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"s966","type":"text","x":6082.6,"y":15202,"width":770,"height":27.3,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7b6292","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42966,"version":1,"versionNonce":92966,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"OUTPUT · AI 原回复 · M028 · 历史回复 · 1/2","originalText":"OUTPUT · AI 原回复 · M028 · 历史回复 · 1/2","fontSize":21,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s967","type":"text","x":6082.6,"y":15241,"width":734,"height":642.2,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#34464b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42967,"version":1,"versionNonce":92967,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"重新对照了四张图，确实是**整体简化过度**。外框承担了内\n容归属和对象身份，丢掉后，动画就变成了文字与线条换位置。\n\n| 范围 | 丢失的关键细节 |\n|---|---|\n| 第一镜 | 用户、系统、环境展开内容的同色外框；四个参数\n的独立槽位；`file_path` 放大及必填对应线 |\n| 第二镜 | 消息从开放到闭合的边界变化；“工具调用”标记外\n框；类型与执行分支、工具名称与入口的对应动作；工具两端端\n口 |\n| 第三镜 | 请求记录的金框、结果的青框；框边配对点及连接\n；加入新输入后仍保留的两个内框 |\n| 回答与结尾 | 白色回答页轮廓；金色工具请求框；“原有输\n入／更新后的输入”的分组说明 |\n\n还有一个核心问题：**带框内容应该作为一个整体移动、复制、\n缩小，当前代码却经常把它变形成几条短线和标签。** 因此即\n使没有隐藏，观众也难以认出它还是刚才那个对象。\n","originalText":"重新对照了四张图，确实是**整体简化过度**。外框承担了内\n容归属和对象身份，丢掉后，动画就变成了文字与线条换位置。\n\n| 范围 | 丢失的关键细节 |\n|---|---|\n| 第一镜 | 用户、系统、环境展开内容的同色外框；四个参数\n的独立槽位；`file_path` 放大及必填对应线 |\n| 第二镜 | 消息从开放到闭合的边界变化；“工具调用”标记外\n框；类型与执行分支、工具名称与入口的对应动作；工具两端端\n口 |\n| 第三镜 | 请求记录的金框、结果的青框；框边配对点及连接\n；加入新输入后仍保留的两个内框 |\n| 回答与结尾 | 白色回答页轮廓；金色工具请求框；“原有输\n入／更新后的输入”的分组说明 |\n\n还有一个核心问题：**带框内容应该作为一个整体移动、复制、\n缩小，当前代码却经常把它变形成几条短线和标签。** 因此即\n使没有隐藏，观众也难以认出它还是刚才那个对象。\n","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3,"customData":{"verbatim":true,"source":"/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0a87b-54cf-7e90-8fe2-f550ac2f1076.md","message":"M028","role":"output","part":1,"parts":2,"sourceText":"重新对照了四张图，确实是**整体简化过度**。外框承担了内容归属和对象身份，丢掉后，动画就变成了文字与线条换位置。\n\n| 范围 | 丢失的关键细节 |\n|---|---|\n| 第一镜 | 用户、系统、环境展开内容的同色外框；四个参数的独立槽位；`file_path` 放大及必填对应线 |\n| 第二镜 | 消息从开放到闭合的边界变化；“工具调用”标记外框；类型与执行分支、工具名称与入口的对应动作；工具两端端口 |\n| 第三镜 | 请求记录的金框、结果的青框；框边配对点及连接；加入新输入后仍保留的两个内框 |\n| 回答与结尾 | 白色回答页轮廓；金色工具请求框；“原有输入／更新后的输入”的分组说明 |\n\n还有一个核心问题：**带框内容应该作为一个整体移动、复制、缩小，当前代码却经常把它变形成几条短线和标签。** 因此即使没有隐藏，观众也难以认出它还是刚才那个对象。\n\n已保存完整的[图片对照复查清单](/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/AI的输入与输出/计划/图片对照复查.md)，覆盖三镜及结尾。这次应按对象结构和完整动作重做，不能继续只补箭头、显隐。图片里的错字、常驻波形和重复执行暗示仍按已确认方案纠正。喵～"}},{"id":"s968","type":"text","x":6082.6,"y":15906.2,"width":770,"height":24.7,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#8b9699","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-10-02-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42968,"version":1,"versionNonce":92968,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":"file:///Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0a87b-54cf-7e90-8fe2-f550ac2f1076.md","locked":false,"text":"01a0a87b · M028","originalText":"01a0a87b · M028","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s969","type":"text","x":5200.6,"y":16113,"width":160,"height":28.6,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#768689","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"scene-10-02","roundness":null,"seed":42969,