,"lineHeight":1.3,"customData":{"verbatim":true,"source":"/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0b362-6510-7212-b628-bb9e584521ae.md","message":"M045","role":"input","part":1,"parts":1,"sourceText":"我并不是希望你重新重绘 HTML，而是通过生图模型来生成每页 PPT 的内容。"}},{"id":"s1100","type":"text","x":3282.6,"y":19626.6,"width":770,"height":24.7,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#8b9699","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":null,"seed":43100,"version":1,"versionNonce":93100,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":"file:///Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0b362-6510-7212-b628-bb9e584521ae.md","locked":false,"text":"01a0b362 · M045","originalText":"01a0b362 · M045","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s1101","type":"rectangle","x":4140.6,"y":19489,"width":796,"height":761.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e2dcc0","backgroundColor":"#faf8ed","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":0.7,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.5,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":43101,"version":1,"versionNonce":93101,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"s1102","type":"line","x":4133.6,"y":19505,"width":0.0,"height":738.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7b6292","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2.6,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.8,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":null,"seed":43102,"version":1,"versionNonce":93102,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0.0,0],[0.0,738.0]],"lastCommittedPoint":null,"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":null,"elbowed":false},{"id":"s1103","type":"ellipse","x":4124.6,"y":19499,"width":18,"height":18,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7b6292","backgroundColor":"#fff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0.8,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":null,"seed":43103,"version":1,"versionNonce":93103,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"s1104","type":"text","x":4152.6,"y":19497,"width":770,"height":27.3,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7b6292","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":null,"seed":43104,"version":1,"versionNonce":93104,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"OUTPUT · AI 原回复 · M046 · 历史回复","originalText":"OUTPUT · AI 原回复 · M046 · 历史回复","fontSize":21,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s1105","type":"text","x":4152.6,"y":19536,"width":734,"height":676.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#34464b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":null,"seed":43105,"version":1,"versionNonce":93105,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"明白，刚才我把生图理解成辅助素材，偏离了你的意思。\n\n你要的是：**由生图模型直接生成每一页完整的 PPT 画面**，\n包括内容编排、文字、图形和整体布局，HTML 只负责承载和播\n放。\n\n整改方向调整为：\n\n- **普通页面**：先提炼该页要讲清的内容，再用生图模型生\n成完整幻灯片，不再用 HTML 拼文字卡片。\n- **两页视频、八页地形演示**：按你之前确认的范围保留。\n- **散点图页面**：用生图模型设计整页视觉与布局，预留图\n表区域；仅在该区域融入可交互散点图，统一色彩和字体，删除\n原网页的数字导航及多余控件。\n- **整套统一**：浅色背景、固定 16:9、统一字体风格和视觉\n语言。逐页检查中文准确性、清晰度及内容质量，不合格的重新\n生成。\n\n最终交付仍是可以翻页、播放视频、操作地形和散点图的 HTML\n 幻灯片，但普通页的完整画面由生图模型制作。喵～","originalText":"明白，刚才我把生图理解成辅助素材，偏离了你的意思。\n\n你要的是：**由生图模型直接生成每一页完整的 PPT 画面**，\n包括内容编排、文字、图形和整体布局，HTML 只负责承载和播\n放。\n\n整改方向调整为：\n\n- **普通页面**：先提炼该页要讲清的内容，再用生图模型生\n成完整幻灯片，不再用 HTML 拼文字卡片。\n- **两页视频、八页地形演示**：按你之前确认的范围保留。\n- **散点图页面**：用生图模型设计整页视觉与布局，预留图\n表区域；仅在该区域融入可交互散点图，统一色彩和字体，删除\n原网页的数字导航及多余控件。\n- **整套统一**：浅色背景、固定 16:9、统一字体风格和视觉\n语言。逐页检查中文准确性、清晰度及内容质量，不合格的重新\n生成。\n\n最终交付仍是可以翻页、播放视频、操作地形和散点图的 HTML\n 幻灯片，但普通页的完整画面由生图模型制作。喵～","fontSize":26,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3,"customData":{"verbatim":true,"source":"/Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0b362-6510-7212-b628-bb9e584521ae.md","message":"M046","role":"output","part":1,"parts":1,"sourceText":"明白，刚才我把生图理解成辅助素材，偏离了你的意思。\n\n你要的是：**由生图模型直接生成每一页完整的 PPT 画面**，包括内容编排、文字、图形和整体布局，HTML 只负责承载和播放。\n\n整改方向调整为：\n\n- **普通页面**：先提炼该页要讲清的内容，再用生图模型生成完整幻灯片，不再用 HTML 拼文字卡片。\n- **两页视频、八页地形演示**：按你之前确认的范围保留。\n- **散点图页面**：用生图模型设计整页视觉与布局，预留图表区域；仅在该区域融入可交互散点图，统一色彩和字体，删除原网页的数字导航及多余控件。\n- **整套统一**：浅色背景、固定 16:9、统一字体风格和视觉语言。逐页检查中文准确性、清晰度及内容质量，不合格的重新生成。\n\n最终交付仍是可以翻页、播放视频、操作地形和散点图的 HTML 幻灯片，但普通页的完整画面由生图模型制作。喵～"}},{"id":"s1106","type":"text","x":4152.6,"y":20235.0,"width":770,"height":24.7,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#8b9699","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["scene-12-01-sequence"],"frameId":"scene-12-01","roundness":null,"seed":43106,"version":1,"versionNonce":93106,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":"file:///Users/w/code/For-Use-AI/Course/PPT课程制作复盘/对话数据/Codex/01a0b362-6510-7212-b628-bb9e584521ae.md","locked":false,"text":"01a0b362 · M046","originalText":"01a0b362 · M046","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.3},{"id":"s1107","type":"text","x":3270.6,"y":20408,"width":160,"height":28.6,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#768689","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.4,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[